## Runtime flags for the OT gateway.
##
## Distribution is only for the release control script (start/stop/remote).
## Bind both EPMD and the distribution listener to loopback so the gateway has
## no inbound TCP port on a network interface. Its real control path is the
## outbound Macula station link; its local health endpoint is a Unix socket.

-name ${MCL_NODE_NAME}@${MCL_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${MCL_COOKIE}
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}

+K true
+A 8
